{"5030410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fluffy Alchemist", "steam_appid": 5030410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somewhere in the open sea lies the Dawn Archipelago - five islands wrapped in ancient magic. The sun never truly sets here: morning flows gently into day, day into evening, and evening blooms back into morning. You are Lumi, a young red panda and field alchemist of the Magic Institute. This is your first solo mission: explore the islands, gather rare ingredients, uncover the secrets of the local flora, and send new potion recipes back to the Institute through the mystical Mirror of Transfer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/55afd25e0bf9add8c4659d4e15c46883.avif?t=1787929766\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/43851ad7722213beb2277bea6f4bea00.poster.avif?t=1787929766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/43851ad7722213beb2277bea6f4bea00.webm?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/43851ad7722213beb2277bea6f4bea00.mp4?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Five islands await discovery, each with its own unique layout and interactive landmarks. Repair ancient statues, collect crystals, unlock portals - and gradually expand your map of the world. Every island hides its own secrets - small puzzles and brief animated scenes that reward attentiveness and curiosity. Solve them to unlock access to new plants and materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/4df7525289b6c4f5fdb37cc79030c02d.avif?t=1787929766\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5e5f403e1fb199c153030696e4dd7f57.poster.avif?t=1787929766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5e5f403e1fb199c153030696e4dd7f57.webm?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5e5f403e1fb199c153030696e4dd7f57.mp4?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every plant and mushroom has its own personality: some hop from spot to spot, others hide beneath heavy boulders, and a few - especially lively ones - might even shower you in disorienting pollen. Explore the world to learn more about every inhabitant of the Archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5bc3aac5b88462a9e5bcdd266cbbc26c.avif?t=1787929766\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/abf0e2de9b8b741cf6389a7c8ba77dde.poster.avif?t=1787929766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/abf0e2de9b8b741cf6389a7c8ba77dde.webm?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/abf0e2de9b8b741cf6389a7c8ba77dde.mp4?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine the plants and ingredients you find scattered across the world, and interactively brew new potions for the Institute - discover 20 unique recipes, from simple tinctures to legendary elixirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/b4a8770c28e8dabc2bff4a47c3f35476.avif?t=1787929766\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/ee108211b102cb01917cda22bd67132b.poster.avif?t=1787929766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/ee108211b102cb01917cda22bd67132b.webm?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/ee108211b102cb01917cda22bd67132b.mp4?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your field journal records every recipe you discover. The goal is simple and clear: fill all the pages and send the book back to the Institute - so the magical world becomes a little better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Somewhere in the open sea lies the Dawn Archipelago - five islands wrapped in ancient magic. The sun never truly sets here: morning flows gently into day, day into evening, and evening blooms back into morning. You are Lumi, a young red panda and field alchemist of the Magic Institute. This is your first solo mission: explore the islands, gather rare ingredients, uncover the secrets of the local flora, and send new potion recipes back to the Institute through the mystical Mirror of Transfer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/55afd25e0bf9add8c4659d4e15c46883.avif?t=1787929766\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/43851ad7722213beb2277bea6f4bea00.poster.avif?t=1787929766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/43851ad7722213beb2277bea6f4bea00.webm?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/43851ad7722213beb2277bea6f4bea00.mp4?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Five islands await discovery, each with its own unique layout and interactive landmarks. Repair ancient statues, collect crystals, unlock portals - and gradually expand your map of the world. Every island hides its own secrets - small puzzles and brief animated scenes that reward attentiveness and curiosity. Solve them to unlock access to new plants and materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/4df7525289b6c4f5fdb37cc79030c02d.avif?t=1787929766\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5e5f403e1fb199c153030696e4dd7f57.poster.avif?t=1787929766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5e5f403e1fb199c153030696e4dd7f57.webm?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5e5f403e1fb199c153030696e4dd7f57.mp4?t=1787929766\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every plant and mushroom has its own personality: some hop from spot to spot, others hide beneath heavy boulders, and a few - especially lively ones - might even shower you in disorienting pollen. Explore the world to learn more about every inhabitant of the Archipelago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/5bc3aac5b88462a9e5bcdd266cbbc26c.avif?t=1787929766\" width=1500 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030410/extras/abf0e2de9b8b741cf6389a7c8ba77dde.poster.avif?t=1787929766\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://